<div class="container">
  <div class="card">
    <h1>About HotelStay</h1>
    <p>HotelStay is a simple hotel booking platform that lets travellers browse hotels,
       compare room types, and book a stay in a few clicks. Hotel owners and staff manage
       inventory and bookings through a dedicated admin dashboard.</p>
    <p>This project demonstrates a classic layered Java web architecture: JSP views,
       Servlet controllers, a DAO data-access layer, JDBC utilities, and filters that
       enforce authentication and role-based access &mdash; without ever asking the user
       to pick their own role at signup.</p>
  </div>
</div>
